Mutation for scripts/joint.sh 8/11 (B3-05, A2A-DESIGN SI-4): the daemon skips the step 7 signature
check (§3.6), so an envelope whose inner from claims an allowed peer, carrying that peer's real KEL
and the attacker's signature, is processed as the peer's. Never commit it applied.

Apply in a scratch worktree, never in a checkout anything ships from:

    cd ANet && git apply scripts/mutations/si4-skip-step7.patch
    go build -o "$MUTBIN/anet" ./cmd/anet    # anetfixture, anetpeer and anet-hub into $MUTBIN as usual
    JOINT_BIN="$MUTBIN" scripts/joint.sh

